  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Social Protection Model for the New Poor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the context of the severe economic crisis Sri Lanka is facing, social protection can offer immediate relief to households with lost or reduced income while building and strengthening the foundation for long-term inclusive growth. The proposal focuses on improving the identification of the newly poor not captured in existing social safety net databases, improving social protection data disaggregation and quality, integrating cash-based interventions with economic empowerment opportunities with</narrative>
  </description>
